     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Thursday, July 7, 2016 at 3:45:26 PM UTC-4, Daniel Lee wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Jonah Gabry, Vince Dorie, and Andrew Gelman are giving a <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/learn-bayes-mcmc-and-stan-with-andrew-gelman-jonah-gabry-vince-dorie-tickets-25554757969\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/learn-bayes-mcmc-and-stan-with-andrew-gelman-jonah-gabry-vince-dorie-tickets-25554757969&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460868185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31IQce5GXvQvCPhyiTJlS9\">3-day short course</a> in NYC in a couple weeks.<div><br></div><div>Andrew put it up on <a href=\"http://andrewgelman.com/2016/06/28/short-course-on-bayesian-data-analysis-and-stan-19-21-july-in-nyc-2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://andrewgelman.com/2016/06/28/short-course-on-bayesian-data-analysis-and-stan-19-21-july-in-nyc-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460868185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MDc7oa9gi9Ynn-ke8PVDK\">his blog</a> with a note on the price.</div><div><br></div><div>And... since you&#39;re on this list, you can get a 20% discount with this promotional code: stanuser.</div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>If you use Windows plus either have a space in the path to the StanHeaders package or have RTools33 installed in a non-standard location, then you need to install a provisional rstan package via<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><pre><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span><span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\"><a href=\"http://win-builder.r-project.org/Z1N0He79FT3r/rstan_2.10.1-1.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://win-builder.r-project.org/Z1N0He79FT3r/rstan_2.10.1-1.zip&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460868185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kPkGZCrmN1K5On5apwDaR\">http://win-builder.r-project.org/Z1N0He79FT3r/rstan_2.10.1-1.zip</a></span><span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">repos</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">dependencies</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></pre></div></code></div><br>Ben<br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div></div>\r\n</div></div>"
